@startuml scope-vpn-sequence
' Copyright (c) 2026 BY-SYSTEMS SRL. MIT License.
participant "Ansible/Consumer" as A
participant "WgServerManager" as WS
participant "WgClientManager" as WC
participant "OPNsense API" as API
participant "Win11/Mobile" as Client

== Key Generation ==
A -> WS: generate_keypair()
WS -> API: POST /api/wireguard/server/keyPair
API --> WS: {privkey, pubkey}
WS --> A: {privkey, pubkey}
A -> A: Store privkey in Vault KV

== Server Tunnel ==
A -> WS: ensure("present", {name:"wg0", privkey, port:51820, tunneladdress:"10.10.0.1/24"})
WS -> API: POST /api/wireguard/server/addServer
API --> WS: {uuid}
WS --> A: EnsureResult(created)

== Share Public Keys ==
A --> Client: server pubkey + endpoint
Client --> A: client pubkey

== Add Peer ==
A -> WC: ensure("present", {name:"win11-rune", pubkey:<client-pub>, tunneladdress:"10.10.0.2/32"})
WC -> API: POST /api/wireguard/client/addClient
API --> WC: {uuid}

== Tunnel Active ==
Client <--> API: WireGuard tunnel (10.10.0.1 <-> 10.10.0.2)
@enduml
